    "CoiStatement": "Conflicts of Interest: Jan Trøst Jørgensen has worked as a consultant for Dako, Agilent Technologies and Euro Diagnostica, and has given lectures at meetings sponsored by AstraZeneca, Merck Sharp & Dohme, and Roche. Maria Hersom has nothing to declare. All the figures included in the manuscript are original and have been developed by Dr. Hersom.",
